{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixingBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixingBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.ofDiagonalScalar_intertwines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.ofDiagonalScalar_intertwines","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L117-L128","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.ofDiagonalScalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.ofDiagonalScalar","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L106-L115","doc":"A diagonal scalar map *is* a level-mixing map (so the excluded\nfamily sits inside the conjectured one — the conjecture is a genuine\nweakening, not a different claim). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.not_diagonal_of_crossMul_fail","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.not_diagonal_of_crossMul_fail","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L96-L104","doc":"**What the negative compute licenses — and no more.** A single\nfailing consecutive pair refutes the diagonal scalar form *at that\nshift*, for every scalar `r` simultaneously. It says nothing about\nlevel-mixing maps, which is exactly the scope-(a) reading recorded in\nthe ledger. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.diagonal_forces_crossMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.diagonal_forces_crossMul","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L83-L94","doc":"**What the compute tested.** A diagonal scalar map forces the exact\ncross-multiplication identity between consecutive levels — the\ncriterion B1.4′ evaluated (and found to fail) for every\n`(sign, j, λ, k)` on its pre-registered grid. Note the scalar `r`\ndrops out: this is why the test is parameter-free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.DiagonalScalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.DiagonalScalar","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L77-L81","doc":"**The excluded form.** A level-diagonal map with a single scalar\ndressing `r` and a fixed shift `k` — the shape B1.3 (row/scalar\ndressing) and B1.4′ (per-level dressing) searched. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge.exists_nondegenerate_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge.exists_nondegenerate_map","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge.mk","kind":"ctor","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMixingBridge","kind":"class","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L64-L75","doc":"**Conjecture (primary, OPEN).** The Masbaum cyclotomic grading of\nthe 5₂ tail is the image of the GGM block grading under a\nlevel-mixing map that is not identically zero.\n\nNo instance is provided: the conjecture is open, and a fabricated\ninstance would assert exactly what is unknown. The non-degeneracy\nfield is what makes the statement have content — without it the zero\nmap satisfies the intertwining whenever `mas ≡ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.Intertwines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.Intertwines","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L60-L62","doc":"`L` intertwines the two level gradings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.finite_support","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.finite_support","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.bound","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.coeff","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.LevelMixing.LevelMap","kind":"structure","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/LevelMixingBridge.lean#L52-L58","doc":"The data of a level-mixing map: coefficients `coeff n m`, a bound\n`bound n` on which target levels level `n` can reach, and the law that\nnothing above the bound contributes. ","signatureChunk":0}]}